graph LR
    UserRequest[User Requests AI Analysis] --> Logic{Quota Available?}
    
    Logic -- Yes --> API[Call Google Gemini API]
    API --> Success{Response OK?}
    
    Success -- Yes --> ReturnAI[Return AI Insights]
    
    Logic -- No / Rate Limited --> CircuitBreaker[Trigger Circuit Breaker]
    Success -- No / Timeout --> CircuitBreaker
    
    CircuitBreaker --> Cache[Fetch Last Cached Analysis]
    Cache --> FallbackMsg[Append Fallback Warning]
    FallbackMsg --> ReturnAI
